Burnoff
=======

Sentinel-2 SWIR flare detection at LNG facilities.

Detects thermal anomalies using B11/B12 bands with local cloud filtering
and contrast-based thresholding. Results displayed on a web map with
on-demand COG visualization.


Requirements
------------

- Python 3.12+ with uv
- DuckDB
- tippecanoe
- Node.js (for npx serve)


Quick Start
-----------

    make all        # Run full pipeline
    make serve      # Start web server on :8000


Detection
---------

Single location:

    uv run burnoff detect --lat -12.51 --lon 130.92 --year 2024

Bulk processing:

    uv run burnoff bulk terminals.json -o detections.json --year 2024


Data Sources
------------

- Sentinel-2 L2A via Element84 STAC API
- SWIR bands: B11 (1610nm), B12 (2190nm)
- Scene classification (SCL) for cloud masking
